      "question3": "What difficulties can people face when studying in these two places?",
      "question3_answer": "A library can be too quiet for group discussion, and seats or useful books may not be available during busy periods.\nIts opening hours can also be limited.\nBoth places can work well, but students should choose based on the task and their own ability to ignore distractions."
