      "question2": "Do you prefer living with family or living alone? Why?",
      "question2_answer": "At this stage of my life, I prefer living with family because we can share meals, housework and daily costs.\nIt is also comforting to have someone nearby when a problem occurs.\nI understand why living alone is attractive, and I may choose it for a period in the future, but at present the support and company of family matter more to me.",
      "question3": "Why do many people choose to live alone nowadays?",
      "question3_answer": "Many people choose to live alone because they work or study far from their family and want independence.\nThey can arrange the home, invite friends and follow a routine without asking anyone else.\nOnline contact, convenient services and active social groups make it easier, but people still need supportive relationships outside the home."
